&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;🎵&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/187967/rss" title="hyperblam.how" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;HYPERBLAM: Make Music with HTML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — A declarative implementation of the Web Audio API for creating things like drum machines (&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/187968/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;example&lt;/a&gt;), instruments and effects boards without writing any JavaScript. You can &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/187969/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;try it in the sandbox here&lt;/a&gt; and create some neat beats of your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heydon Pickering &lt;/p&gt;
